    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "Now why is that otto.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "1988-147956-0003",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/2035-147960-0000": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 9.2,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "She was four years older than i to be sure and had seen more of the world but i was a boy and she was a girl and i resented her protecting manner.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2035-147960-0000",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/2035-147960-0004": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 4.075,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "It was on one of these gravel beds that i met my adventure.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2035-147960-0004",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/2086-149220-0004": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 7.625,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "Phoebe wondered whose care and toil it could have been that had planted these vegetables and kept the soil so clean and orderly.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2086-149220-0004",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/2277-149896-0002": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 4.85,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "Hurstwood walked the floor mentally arranging the chief points of his situation.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2277-149896-0002",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/5536-43358-0001": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 9.375,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "The original attitude of the american indian toward the eternal the great mystery that surrounds and embraces us was as simple as it was exalted.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "5536-43358-0001",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/777-126732-0000": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 3.025,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "All idealisation makes life poorer.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "777-126732-0000",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/777-126732-0004": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 4.7,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "And ever since he had never managed to get his weight down as much as an ounce.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "777-126732-0004",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/7976-110124-0003": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 7.55,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "When it was evening he led his band into a nearby street and in his disguise approached the merchant's house he knocked at the door.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "7976-110124-0003",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/8297-275156-0002": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 6.05,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "We have both seen the same newspaper of course and you have been the first to clear the thing up that's it isn't it.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "8297-275156-0002",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_adam/84-121123-0001": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 5.075,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_adam",
    "text": "But in less than five minutes the staircase groaned beneath an extraordinary weight.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "84-121123-0001",
    "voice": "am_adam"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/1673-143396-0007": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 7.35,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_puck",
    "text": "But the prevailing doctrine of the eternity and inherent pravity of matter infected the primitive churches of the east.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "1673-143396-0007",
    "voice": "am_puck"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/1988-147956-0004": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 7.175,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_puck",
    "text": "Presently against one of those banks i saw a sort of shed thatched with the same wine colored grass that grew everywhere.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "1988-147956-0004",
    "voice": "am_puck"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/2035-147960-0001": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 3.45,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_puck",
    "text": "This change came about from an adventure we had together.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2035-147960-0001",
    "voice": "am_puck"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/2086-149214-0000": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 9.55,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_puck",
    "text": "The narrative it may be is woven of so humble a texture as to require this advantage and at the same time to render it the more difficult of attainment.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2086-149214-0000",
    "voice": "am_puck"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/2086-149220-0005": {
    "dataset": "kokoro-82M",
    "duration_s": 8.55,
    "engine": "kokoro",
    "native_sr": 24000,
    "output_sr": 16000,
    "resampled": true,
    "source_id": "kokoro_am_puck",
    "text": "Bees too strange to say had thought it worth their while to come hither possibly from the range of hives beside some farm house miles away.",
    "text_normalisation": "caps->sentence-case + terminal period",
    "utterance_id": "2086-149220-0005",
    "voice": "am_puck"
  },
  "kokoro/kokoro_am_puck/2277-149896-0003": {
